feat(branding): replace the remaining Telegram logo assets

Telegram API ToS: an unofficial client must not use the official Telegram
logo. These assets still showed the paper plane. All replacements are
original artwork (the istylegraph speech bubble with three dots, brand
color #5B3FD9) and are app-module overrides, so upstream files are not
changed.

- raw/plane_logo_plain.json (Lottie): QR screen logo (QrActivity) and
  the round-video watermark (InstantCameraVideoEncoderOverlayHelper,
  RoundVideoOverlayRenderer). 60 frames, because the callers read
  frames up to 52 (watermark) and frame 33 (QR share image).
- raw/qr_code_logo.json (Lottie): center of the QR bottom sheets and the
  update-required screen (BlockingUpdateView).
- raw/qr_logo.svg: center of generated QR codes (TelegramQRCodeWriter).
- drawable-anydpi/logo_middle.xml: Terms of Service dialog
  (TermsOfServiceView). The anydpi vector wins over the upstream
  density PNGs.

The watermark atlas uses only the alpha channel, so the bubble has real
holes for the dots (even-odd fill) there.
